extras helpers imported as described.\n\nOne nuance worth noting rather than a correction: the account binding is per-*role* as well as per-request — the home 推荐 feed is bound to a separate \"recommend role\" account that may itself be anonymous, so \"per-request account binding\" is layered on top of role resolution in `ApiType`/`Accounts`.\n\nReady for the audit findings list; no files were modified.\n\n[warmup-complete]","ttft_ms":2849,"type":"result","duration_ms":15353,"uuid":"3646b094-c5a4-461a-aaea-e97ab2eb9d0a","ttft_stream_ms":2184,"time_to_request_ms":451,"first_content_frame_ms":2185,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
